          "text": "nkaambo Makani Mabotu ngitukambauka naakasika kulindinywe, tecakasika amajwi alike pe, akeza anguzu a-Muuya Uusalala akulamwa kunji kwamumoyo, Mulizi nobeni mbutwakabede nkaambo kandinywe nitwakakede akati kanu, ",
